From 59b4e5448338f1923e933cc841330bc91eacb163 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 16:04:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add get_minute_forecast service to Google Weather

Adds an on-demand google_weather.get_minute_forecast entity service on
the weather entity returning the minute-by-minute precipitation nowcast
(forecast/minutes:lookup). On-demand only: no coordinator and no polling,
so the default API quota spend is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CJh8vCGeayU99A1RYNYGD1
